# Visual Studio / .NET Core gitignore
# Generated for an ASP.NET Core (.NET 10) Visual Studio project

## Visual Studio
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Build results
/bin/
/obj/
**/bin/
**/obj/

## Publish output
/publish/
**/publish/

## NuGet
*.nupkg
# The packages folder can be ignored because of PackageReference
packages/
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

## Rider
.idea/

## Visual Studio Code
.vscode/

## ASP.NET Core
wwwroot/lib/
node_modules/
bower_components/

## User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache

## Resharper
_ReSharper*/
*.ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

## Test results
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
coverage*/

## Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

## Debug/Release output
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb

## Generated files
*.generated.cs

## SQL Server files
*.mdf
*.ldf

## User secrets
secrets.json
.env
appsettings.*.local.json

## OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## JetBrains
*.iml

# Ensure EF migrations and code are tracked (do not ignore Migrations folder by default)
